---
title: Memory Subsystem
---
flowchart TB
    Chat([Chat turn])
    UI([Memory and Scout UI])

    Proposal[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>semantic interest proposal]
    Review{Visible approval}
    Coordinator[MemoryCoordinatorAgent]
    Services[Application-owned services and write policy<br/>user scope · consent where required]
    Retrieval[Scope, expiry,<br/>relevance and dedup]
    Context[Bounded literal context]

    Short[Short term<br/>LLM context window<br/>Session working memory<br/>Semantic cache]
    Long[Long term<br/>Procedural / workflow · Toolbox<br/>Entity · Knowledge base · Persona<br/>Semantic · Episodic<br/>Summaries · Conversations]

    Inference[Provider-neutral<br/>inference adapter]
    TextEmbed[Nomic text embedding<br/>via vLLM]
    Database[(PostgreSQL and pgvector)]
    Maintenance[Retention, re-embedding,<br/>health, export and delete]
    Discovery[Scout fact projection<br/>home and interests]

    Main[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>assistant call via vLLM]

    Chat --> Proposal --> Review --> Services
    Chat --> Coordinator
    UI --> Services
    Coordinator --> Services
    Services --> Short
    Services --> Long
    Services --> Discovery --> Database
    Coordinator --> Retrieval
    Short --> Retrieval
    Long --> Retrieval
    Retrieval --> Context --> Inference
    Inference -->|main role| Main
    Services --> Inference
    Inference -->|embedding role| TextEmbed --> Database
    Short -->|expiring records| Database
    Long -->|durable records| Database
    Maintenance --> Database

